ti-mesa-pvr (25.2.8-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of TexasInstruments/mesa powervr/25.2.8 (commit 7b6e8de),
    the Mesa TI pairs with DDK 26.x on kernel 6.18.
  * Built with -Dgallium-pvr-alias=tidss so display (tidss) rendering is
    routed to the GPU.
  * Verified on BeagleBone AI-64: eglinfo GBM renderer PowerVR Rogue GE8430,
    OpenGL ES 3.2 build 26.1@6967606; glmark2-es2-drm score 385 (llvmpipe 23).

